# ~/.claude is Claude Code's live working directory. It holds conversation
# transcripts, shell snapshots, caches, telemetry and (on some platforms)
# credentials, and the tool creates new state files here without warning.
#
# So: ignore everything by default, then re-include only hand-authored config.
# Anything new that Claude Code drops in here stays untracked automatically.

*

# --- Authored configuration (the only tracked content) ---
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!README.md
!settings.json
!statusline.sh

!rules/
!rules/**

!skills/
!skills/**

# --- Re-ignore noise inside the paths above (last match wins) ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
